  MGTH_J095548.1+020754 (sep 0.8", z 0.0167): W50 67.32 km/s = 12.0 ch -> 5.6100 km/s/ch; rest-frame predicts 5.6063 (+0.0007), observed-frame 5.6999 (-0.0158); channel rounding allows +-0.0042; catalogue W50 67
  MGTH_J095741.3+023406 (sep 0.6", z 0.0907): W50 84.858 km/s = 14.1 ch -> 6.0183 km/s/ch; rest-frame predicts 6.0143 (+0.0007), observed-frame 6.5598 (-0.0825); channel rounding allows +-0.0035; catalogue W50 85
  MGTH_J100008.1+024554 (sep 0.7", z 0.0291): W50 264.04 km/s = 46.5 ch -> 5.6783 km/s/ch; rest-frame predicts 5.6745 (+0.0007), observed-frame 5.8395 (-0.0276); channel rounding allows +-0.0011; catalogue W50 264
  MGTH_J100057.2+030830 (sep 1.7", z 0.0293): W50 420.287 km/s = 74.0 ch -> 5.6796 km/s/ch; rest-frame predicts 5.6758 (+0.0007), observed-frame 5.8421 (-0.0278); channel rounding allows +-0.0007; catalogue W50 420
